{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05309","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 辛替否","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洪慈均动植，至德俯深玄。\n出豫从初地，登高适梵天。\n白云飞御藻，慧日暖皇编。\n别有秋原藿，长倾雨露缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"辛替否","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}